          <h1 id="ly-title" data-fx="wipe">Lymphoma Treatment in <span class="grad-text">Bangalore</span></h1>
          <p class="phero__sub" data-fx="fade" style="--d:.15s">Lymphoma is a blood cancer that starts in lymphocytes, the infection-fighting white blood cells of the lymphatic system. It often first shows as a painless swelling in the neck, armpit or groin. Lymphoma is one of the most treatable cancers, and many types can be cured, especially when found early.</p>
          <div class="hero__acts" data-fx="fade" style="--d:.25s">
